  <rdf:Description rdf:nodeID="commodity_quilt_cb16c72715c597cc5328b66e7fe9f11a4420e0a3cfd3205b0b22dc4fe00326c8831">
    <crm:P190_has_symbolic_content>an article of bed-furniture, consisting of two large pieces of woven material having a layer of some soft substance (wool, flock or down) between them; in later use a coverlet, especially one in which the lining is kept in place by stitches or lines of stitching (OED s.v. quilt n.1)</crm:P190_has_symbolic_content>
